    "source": "Vertex average of the BAG 0363100012135250 ring (RD, PDOK BAG WFS, CC0); the complex is four BAG pands of 1991 (main block 0363100012135250, tower 0363100012236811, Tesselschadestraat block 0363100012073194, shop gallery and drum 0363100012233595) and the massing is one prism per 3DBAG LoD2.2 roof piece of those pands (CC BY 4.0) in native east/south metres above the street at 0.30 m NAP (scripts/landmarks/byzantium-prepare.ts). Window pattern, tower grid, drum and gallery read from Wikimedia Commons photographs (Milliped CC BY-SA 4.0, Fred Romero CC BY 2.0) and Gemeente Amsterdam panoramas (CC BY 4.0); see scripts/landmarks/byzantium-inventory.json and byzantium-elevations.json."
