    "modifications": "Original texture-free flat-colour geometry on 3DBAG LoD2.2 roof pieces (CC BY 4.0) and BAG footprints (CC0): the tiled slab with its staggered window pairs and set-back top storey, the tower's frame grid and cream flank, the gold-edged shop gallery and arcade, the BYZANTIUM entrance lettering, the cantilevered gold drum penthouse with its column and strut, the Tesselschadestraat portal frame and window ribbons, the balconied courtyard wings; read for proportion and tone from Wikimedia Commons photographs by Milliped (CC BY-SA 4.0) and Fred Romero (CC BY 2.0), Gemeente Amsterdam panoramas (CC BY 4.0) and the PDOK orthophoto (CC BY 4.0). Names and dates: Wikipedia nl 'Byzantium (gebouw)' (CC BY-SA 4.0). No pixels or meshes imported."
